# Proctoring binaries are BUILD ARTIFACTS, provisioned by `bun run proctor:assets`
# and ignored by git (see .gitignore). They used to be tracked here under Git LFS.
#
# That was removed on 2026-08-25: Railway's Docker build does `COPY . .` from a
# checkout that never hydrates LFS, so production served the raw pointer TEXT in
# place of every .wasm and .task. Face detection was dead for every interview and
# nothing said so. Restoring LFS tracking here would restore that failure mode.
#
# The WASM runtime now comes from node_modules (lockfile-pinned, so the binaries
# cannot disagree with the MediaPipe package the code imports) and the models are
# downloaded from pinned, checksummed URLs.
